In India, the annual salary for a SOC Analyst L1 (Tier 1) in 2026 typically ranges from ₹3.2 LPA to ₹6.5 LPA for freshers, with an average of around ₹5 LPA to ₹5.6 LPA. Salaries can rise to ₹10-24 LPA with added seniority, certifications, and experience. Top metros like Bangalore and Pune offer higher pay.

